# steps/named-struct-exec.md, slice 1 (plan §3 :245 (a)): a named Structure whose body holds a
# statement besides its field declarations -- Q19.2 = 2, "the whole body, as a method's".  Today its
# body takes field declarations only, refused.  Slice 1 flips this row.
Counter:
    size_t: n 0U
    n: n + 1U
end: Counter
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 0; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
